      "Alpha values <=16 can form near-invisible edge residue outside the retained rects; the visible subject and alpha >16 edge pixels are retained.",
      "The original island-scene.png is an opaque full-bleed 1536x1024 illustration with the tallest pine touching/cropped by its top edge; it is not a transparent island sprite.",
      "moss-clover contains a fixed rock. Do not animate rock scale when using growth variants.",
      "carrot shows an exposed orange root in the mature reference; a planted growth variant should retain only a visible root shoulder."
    ]
